'' A binding that cannot be written -- here, into a directory that does not exist -- is
'' TKO0121, after the import itself succeeded.
'' TEST: cli
'' HOSTS[macos-arm64]: windows macos
''     (with no macOS SDK, a Linux host's own /usr/include answers the import)
'' ARGS: -cimport tests/cimport/src/shapes.h -cimport-out tests/cimport/src/no-such-dir/shapes.bi
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0121: cannot write the binding 'tests/cimport/src/no-such-dir/shapes.bi'
'' EXPECT-NO-FILE: tests/cimport/src/no-such-dir/shapes.bi
